hobbes-leviathan-1.logic.r2: argue/scope: A2: read with the obligation on its consequent alone, def_evident → O acknowledge_deductions, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, O(def_evident → acknowledge_deductions), C (S5) does not follow: it needs the ought on the consequent alone (narrow scope), not only on the conditional (wide), and which the sentence means decides the argument
